        "TileImage": "$($repository c1fc7d29-9d37-4836-bdc0-02d693918dd8).Image",
        "Description": "[TIPS AT BOTTOM]\r\rThe noose tightens, 47.\r\rProvidence, in an attempt to decipher your techniques, has hired a trio marketing themselves as &quot;The X Filers&quot;. Lead by Ms. Mendel, these are stellar criminal profilers who were attentively observing you hunt down the agents just now.\rEliminate them before fleeing, or else their observation will fall into Edwards&apos; hands. We mustn&apos;t let them demystify you.\r\rI demand you spare all other lives, 47! Understood?\r\r\r- oLVa\r\r\rTips: BATTERY&gt;PUDDLE, COIN&gt;TOILET",
